cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CLI-It in your research or tooling, please cite it as below."
title: "CLI-It: Agent-native stateful CLI interfaces for real software"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The CLI-It Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KcAnom/cli-it"
url: "https://elev8tion.github.io/cli-it"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.4.1
date-released: 2026-07-19
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - cli
  - developer-tools
  - automation
abstract: >-
  CLI-It is a monorepo ecosystem that makes GUI/desktop/SaaS software
  agent-native. It provides a 7-phase methodology (HARNESS.md) that coding
  agents follow to generate stateful CLI harnesses around real software, a
  package manager (cli-it) with capability matrices and a preview viewer, and
  registries published as a static hub site. The architecture is inspired by
  HKUDS/CLI-Anything, rebuilt under the CLI-It name.
